# Feature: IPC bridge

## Transport

- Electron `child_process.spawn(venv python, ["-u", "python/main.py"], { stdio: pipe })`.
- `PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1`.
- One JSON object per line on stdin/stdout.
- **stdout = protocol only.** All logs, TF warnings, traceback → stderr.

## Messages

```json
{"id": "1", "method": "classify_and_ingest", "params": {"paths": ["/abs/a.wav"]}}
{"id": "1", "ok": true, "result": {"jobs": []}}
{"id": "1", "ok": false, "error": "message"}
{"type": "event", "name": "progress", "payload": {"file": "a.wav", "stage": "yamnet", "pct": 40}}
```

## Methods

| method | params | result |
| --- | --- | --- |
| ping | {} | {pong:true} |
| get_config | {} | config or {needsOnboarding:true} |
| save_config | {libraryRoot, thresholds…} | {ok:true} |
| classify_and_ingest | {paths: string[]} | {jobs: JobResult[]} |
| list_library | {} | {libraryRoot, folders, recentlyAdded, favorites, collections} |
| move_file | {src, destFolder} | {path} — src must be inside libraryRoot; destFolder is Mixed or an AudioSet class |
| rename_file | {path, newName} | {path} — basename only; extension kept if omitted |
| delete_file | {path} | {ok:true} — file only, must be inside libraryRoot |
| set_favorite | {path, favorite} | {path, favorite} — persist per libraryRoot; not a disk folder |
| create_collection | {name} | {id, name} — virtual list, no mkdir |
| add_to_collection | {id, path} | {id, path} — path must be a library file |
| prepare_playback | {path} | {previewPath, duration, peaksMin, peaksMax, …} — 16-bit temp WAV + waveform peaks; original unchanged |
| history_state | {} | {canUndo, canRedo} — session stack in the Python process |
| undo | {} | {canUndo, canRedo} |
| redo | {} | {canUndo, canRedo} |

`destFolder` must be `Mixed` or a sanitized AudioSet class name.

## Electron

- `ipcMain.handle("python-call", (e, method, params) => pythonCall(method, params))`
- Promise map keyed by `id`. Bad stdout lines are logged, not fatal.
- Events: `webContents.send("python-event", msg)`
- preload: `window.fieldy.call`, `onEvent`, `pathForFile`, `statPath`, `chooseLibraryRoot`, `readPlaybackFile`, `startLibraryDrag`, `showInFinder`, `openExternal`
- Spawn `.venv/bin/python` (`PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1`, `PYTHONPATH=python`). Missing venv → error dialog.
- If Python exits, reject in-flight promises and respawn unless the app is quitting.
- `contextIsolation: true`, `nodeIntegration: false`, `sandbox: true`.

## Security

Do not enable `nodeIntegration`. Validate paths in Python. Ingest moves into `libraryRoot` only. `read-playback-file` is restricted to `fieldy-play-*.wav` under the OS temp directory. `start-library-drag` and `show-in-finder` only accept existing `.wav`/`.wave` files inside the pointer `libraryRoot` (originals, not playback temps). `open-external` only accepts `https://` URLs.

Root `package.json` `npm start` → `electron/`. Move-to `<select>` must set `color` (native select defaults to black on the dark UI).
